sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as 用户 / User
  participant App as Application
  participant DB as Database
  User->>+App: 查询订单 / Fetch orders
  Note over App,DB: 中文与 English 混排
  alt Found
    App->>DB: SELECT orders
    DB-->>App: Results
  else Missing
    App-->>User: No orders
  end
  App-->>-User: 完成 / Done
